* {{rhymes|id|sa|s=3}}
* {{hyph|id|ba|ha|sa}}

===Noun===
{{id-noun}}

# [[language]]
## {{senseid|id|Q315}} a [[body]] of [[word]]s, and set of methods of combining them (called a [[grammar]]), understood by a [[community]] and used as a form of [[communication]]
## a [[sublanguage]]: the [[slang]] of a [[particular]] [[community]] or [[jargon]] of a [[particular]] [[specialist]] [[field]]
## the expression of thought (the communication of meaning) in a specified way; that which communicates something, as language does
## a body of sounds, signs and/or signals by which animals communicate, and by which plants are sometimes also thought to communicate
## the particular words used in a speech or a [[passage]] of text
## {{lb|id|computing}} a computer language; a machine language
##: {{syn|id|bahasa komputer|bahasa mesin}}
